OL,3,GNEWSAOwner of hotel hit by flash
OL,4,Aflooding praises staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen hotel owner Luke Allen was running
OL,7,Fhome from work along Scarborough's
OL,8,Fseafront on Friday, he thought nothing
OL,9,Fof the 10-minute downpour which soaked
OL,10,Fhim.
OL,12,FBut, little did he know the weather,
OL,13,Fbrought by Storm Austen, was causing
OL,14,Fchaos at his business, the Weston Hotel
OL,15,Fon the town's South Cliff.
OL,17,FWhen the message got through to him, he
OL,18,Fand his wife, Steph, immediately
OL,19,Fattempted to drive back to work,
OL,20,Fbattling through the flooded roads.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
